{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/77338e541e95aee9df344cd35c91c474.avif?t=1773815647\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island Master, welcome to your very own island! \u30fd(\uffe3\u25bd\uffe3)\uff89</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land awaits restoration\u2014earn gold coins to rebuild it from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constructing buildings will make the island more prosperous, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >attract more visitors, and bring in more tax revenue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings also unlock new features, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >allowing you to dress up in stylish outfits, sell delicious food and goods\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/fa6bc343a3a9a80a030652e4e8ba5525.avif?t=1773815647\" width=615 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/dc107c911b49d3f0ca5da12d63d45da5.avif?t=1773815647\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sow a seed in spring, reap a bounty in autumn. (=\u03c9=\uff1b)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate the reclaimed farmland with seeds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potatoes, tomatoes, carrots, beets, pumpkins, wheat\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your harvested crops or cook them into delicious meals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/66332f395f48a48ed3e22a52e71a1f70.avif?t=1773815647\" width=615 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/d32d2c4d0312648564f8ba491a64c74d.avif?t=1773815647\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whip out your fishing rod anytime, cast your bait into the water, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and enjoy your fishing time! (&gt;\u03c9\uff65*)\uff89</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can catch fish of all sizes, reel in rare species,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and even hook polluted fish that have turned grotesque!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/3a10213b57b9d8f3f21815ce22d1a8cf.avif?t=1773815647\" width=615 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/2ebaa713419a42a0069da02633032364.avif?t=1773815647\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail with friends and steer your ship toward distant horizons!\u00a0 ...\u309b(\u30ce\uff1e\uff1c)\u30ce</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore faraway islands, hunt for treasures, and discover better fishing spots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the journey, you might encounter reefs, shipwrecks, and stranded pets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/468f48ade9ac2f2f43ca70a508d7cc6c.avif?t=1773815647\" width=615 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/cc31ee827e68f59349bdc3a02e885515.avif?t=1773815647\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss ingredients from farming or fishing into the cooking pot! \uffe3\ufe43\uffe3\ud83c\udf5f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more ingredients you add, the bigger the feast you can cook up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(I get the logic, but how can fries be this huge!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/cbd983b751deccb469a5cd7ece604cdf.avif?t=1773815647\" width=615 height=310 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655990?t=1773815647","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/b17a515f670f409afe0549c9138c7981e6090311/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773815647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/b725250b0c7fe77acb63a1c3ec7b02f974063284/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773815647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/b725250b0c7fe77acb63a1c3ec7b02f974063284/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773815647","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4341440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/77338e541e95aee9df344cd35c91c474.avif?t=177381